+# Native RK charge stability handoff
+
+Stacked dependency: PR8038, source86e03ef9a8eaafb9106304bf54cc0a991c758001. Current main inspected:e4b4fd46db. Its new role/readout files do not alter the declared native/ice premises. This branch adds one note, five runner files, paired output and the one-node/one-edge graph acknowledgment; inherited dictionary content remains unchanged.
+
+The final note combines all-position static support, the native hopping lower bound, the ordered signed-hole trial and exact double counting. For the supplied finite low-charge Hamiltonian, 2U-8|t| <= E_D2 <= 2U-36|t|/5. Neutral zero states are ground states for U>=4|t| and cannot be ground states for U<18|t|/5. The intermediate interval and actual physical Hamiltonian remain open. The phase-correct trial includes every D2 configuration and winding sector; no mixing or preparation is assumed.
+
+Final independent source review is REVIEW.md, with exact source closure in READ_HASHES.json and SOURCE_FREEZE.json. It confirms the static proof, nonuniform nonnegative J_p extension, native phase accounting, all declared bounds and canonical adaptations. Earlier partial review and actual runs are preserved under before-variational-expansion; the alarm repair is explicit. Five actual semantic mutations fail their intended predicates.
+
+Fresh seven-file isolated `python3 -I -OO` closure executes419017 explicit predicates in1.072068s with22.765625MiB peak RSS. ISOLATED.stdout and ISOLATED_CLOSURE.json carry actual source-bound output. These finite controls support the general proof; they are not full charge-sector enumerations. No audit verdict or physical mass/neutral-gap/mobility/deconfinement claim is made.
+
+One combined full pipeline, strict lint and changed-evidence check remain deferred to the exact authorized landing candidate. They were not run on this science branch, and independent review does not apply an audit status. This science task opens review PRs but does not merge them.
+
+The separately checked D4 exchange witness is not included in this frozen block. It remains campaign research for the next coherent global charge-support argument.
