+
+The canonical upper-bound proof matches that independently checked argument. Charge-ordered c_x c_y|F> makes both signed hole moves negative after the exact W map; it does not discard native phases or extend to same-species exchange sectors. Ring flips retain positive amplitudes because positions are unchanged. The all-D2 trial includes every component and winding sector and is not a preparation claim. Nonuniform nonnegative Jp annihilate it termwise. A means adjacent AND eligible; adjacent ineligible states belong B. The6A<=4B double count uses triangle freedom and at most two common neighbors on precisely the stated cubic domain, giving mean degree>=36/5. Negative t is handled by the bipartite phase epsilon_x epsilon_y. The critical U<18|t|/5 statement excludes neutral zero states as global grounds only; the intervening region and optimal threshold remain unresolved.
