+# Trace gate
+
+Target: establish a controlled finite charged sector for the provisional full native carrier model, retaining phase and support constraints. This is frontier discovery, not retirement of an axiom-level physical supplier.
+
+```yaml
+trace_class: frontier_discovery
+target_claim_id: null
+target_blocker_text: null
+source_of_blocker_text: frontier_question
+reachability_to_target: unknown_frontier
+artifact_role: theorem
+next_trace_action: "Test neutral-field behavior and physically supplied dynamics; do not infer a physical mass from the charge bound."
+```
+
+Current main e4b4fd46db adds finite role/static readout source but does not modify the dictionary's native algebra or ice premise notes. The carrier dictionary is unmerged PR8038, head86e03ef9a8eaafb9106304bf54cc0a991c758001, and this block is stacked on it. The new argument adds static signed-pair support and a hopping-stable charged-sector bound. No Record occurrence, preparation, physical Hamiltonian or continuum supplier is supplied.
