+---
+claim_id: native_rk_charge_stability_note_2026-09-08
+claim_type: bounded_theorem
+claim_scope: "Finite even cubic tori with extents at least four, full native edge carrier and supplied low-charge RK Hamiltonian: all-position static signed-pair support, exact static pair energy 2U, operator bound H >= (U-4|t|)D, neutral zero-energy ground states for U>=4|t|, charged-sector gap at least 2(U-4|t|) in the strict region, and two-charge upper bound 2U-36|t|/5. No physical mass, neutral gap or mobile deconfinement conclusion."
+upstream_dependencies:
+  - native_dynamical_cycle_fermion_z2_dictionary_note_2026-09-08
